<p>President Trump hosted Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi at the White House on Thursday. The meeting had seemed likely to focus on trade and China, but the war with Iran and security in the Strait of Hormuz quickly took center stage. Japan has resisted U.S. pressure to send ships to help reopen the waterway, even as Washington has urged allies to contribute and tied the issue to energy markets and regional stability. Even with that tension, several outlets said the public opening was warm. Both leaders praised the U.S.-Japan relationship and signaled interest in continued cooperation on trade, energy stability, and regional security. The meeting also drew notice after Trump referenced Pearl Harbor, a moment The New York Times and The Straits Times highlighted as unusual in such a closely watched alliance meeting.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/SBdCUADRQ5fv39Fgxzw-l2fEZ2hN3yCTvrbXazAFxffhr2vanMi1pbbrNf2DPU_vGlzYJ_fTpGmiQ0WoMCXitS10kxVJIRyS1NpkDhaBi7I1h_eL2ObB7A4BSBUEUXdSKTCGASyc4j4C6A7bkYYeLWxbGmRg1jDrGNfUZ9zcbj2FlhnXhqppcCwwKYZoPT0gvDah9MOUYMrzenWt' alt='President Trump meets Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi at the White House on March 19, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>First ally: Takaichi was the first U.S. ally to visit the White House after President Trump asked partners to help patrol the Strait of Hormuz, making the meeting an early test of allied support.</li><li>China delayed: Semafor reported that the Iran war led President Trump to delay his planned China trip while the administration searched for ways to ease high gasoline prices.</li><li>Oil policy shift: Semafor reported that the Iran war also pushed President Trump to drop efforts to squeeze Russia&#x27;s oil revenue as the administration looked for ways to ease gasoline prices.</li><li>Changed tone: Semafor said Trump and Takaichi had a bonhomie-filled meeting last fall, a contrast with today&#x27;s tougher talks over Hormuz.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: He praised Takaichi in public and said Tokyo was &#x27;really stepping up to the plate&#x27; on Iran. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-hails-japanese-leader-says-tokyo-really-stepping-up-to-the-plate-on-iran'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi: She came into the talks trying to protect trade ties with Washington while also signaling Japan&#x27;s preference for an end to the Iran conflict that could lower energy costs. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/japans-pm-faces-highwire-meeting-with-trump'>Semafor</a>)</li><li>European officials: One European official said it was important to keep attention on Ukraine even as the Iran war consumed more of the Trump administration&#x27;s time. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/as-takaichi-visits-iran-preoccupies-white-house'>Semafor</a>)</li><li>Council on Foreign Relations analyst: The analyst said Takaichi had to balance Japan&#x27;s desire for peace with the need to show a skeptical President Trump the value of the U.S.-Japan alliance. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/japans-pm-faces-highwire-meeting-with-trump'>Semafor</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/watch-live-trump-meets-with-japanese-prime-minister-sanae-takaichi-at-the-white-house'>WATCH: Trump meets with Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi at the White House</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/japans-pm-faces-highwire-meeting-with-trump'>Japan PM faces highwire meeting with Trump</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/19/g-s1-114405/japan-takaichi-visit-white-house'>Japan&#x27;s prime minister visits the White House under shadow of Iran war</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/19/us/politics/trump-japan-pearl-harbor-oval-office-takaichi.html'>Trump Jokes About Pearl Harbor in Meeting With Japan’s Leader</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/us/diplomacy/article/3347220/trump-talks-japanese-prime-minister-sanae-takaichi-positive-start'>Trump talks with Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi off to positive start</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-draws-parallel-between-pearl-harbor-and-us-strikes-on-iran-in-meeting-with-japanese-pm'>Trump draws parallel between Pearl Harbor and US strikes on Iran in meeting with Japanese PM</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-war-live-80-years-after-hiroshima-horror-japan-drawn-into-iran-nuclear-crisis-by-donald-trump-11239531#publisher=newsstand'>80 Years After Hiroshima Horror, Japan Drawn Into Iran Nuke Crisis By Trump</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cde4e2xyelpo'>Japan PM to hold &#x27;difficult&#x27; talks with Trump as Iran conflict looms large</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/trump-says-japan-stepping-up-to-the-plate-on-iran/'>Trump says Japan ‘stepping up to the plate’ on Iran</a> - michaelwest.com.au</li></ul>